Dear Mike,

You could consider a Dail-Madsen model (function pcountOpen), which keeps the site info across years. If that does not work, then I would not try to shoehoern your problem into an lmer analysis at all costs, but go down the BUGS avenue, where all of this ought to be straightforward.

Best regards  --- Marc

